<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!-- Opposite sides of a road. Test data written for this repo. The places are invented,
     modelled on three real kinds of case: two rest area pins either side of a
     highway (case 1), a rest area pin that is a vertex of a car park inside the
     rest area's outline (case 2), and a free pin inside a rest area outline on
     the other side of a motorway (case 3). Cases 4 to 7 test the edge distance,
     tertiary roads, the never-merge signals and minor roads. -->
